// WHY THIS FILE IMPORTS NOTHING UNDER `v1.`. The claim corpus is `gunbc.ci.ci_layer_roots
// ::witness_layer_roots` = ["dag", "src/v2"], and `v1.compiler.stage0_crates` lives under `src/v1`,
// where that corpus cannot bind it -- an import of it is a resolve refusal, not a slow path. The
// boundary-write arms that needed it now live where they can be answered: the authored-only crate
// and its module list are asserted by the host test
// the_boundary_write_gives_an_authored_only_package_its_manifest_and_module_list in
// src/v1/stage0/src/required_regen_host.rs, which calls the same fold over a fixture row set, and the
// call sites that must ask the fold are pinned by the live-tree arm in
// dag/test/claim/required_regen_admission_witness.dag.

